There are 3 files in the libdevmapper submodule that are changed.
The original files cause compile errors.
This directory also has the copies of the these 3 files after they are changed.

The changes in these files were made before the necessary change in toolchain.cmake was made.
In another word, the submodule may not need change at all, but I don't have to clean up the entire build directory
and re-run build just to find out whether this submodule can work as it is.

The changes in these 3 files are toward the end of each file respectively.




adaptiva@debian-12-1:~/osquery/libraries/cmake/source/libdevmapper/src$ git status
